 it('A26 部分原因仍在時只由該原因登錄的承載者形成事件',()=>{let m=model();m=act(m,{type:'ResolveCause',causeId:'dong-zhuo-central-control',reason:'示例勢力完成中央交接'});m=advancePhase4(m,6*360);expect(m.nodes.find(n=>n.contentId==='coalition-190')).toMatchObject({status:'triggered',carrier:'仍維持武裝的州郡勢力（因果承載示例）'});});
 it('職缺任命保留空缺至到任日，繼任有明確交接時間',()=>{let m=model();m=act(m,{type:'Appoint',officeId:'office-clerk',personId:'p1'});expect(m.offices[0].holderId).toBeNull();m=advancePhase4(m,ENGINEERING.appointmentTravelDays-1);expect(m.offices[0].holderId).toBeNull();m=advancePhase4(m,1);expect(m.offices[0].holderId).toBe('p1');});
 it('人才邀請尊重本人拒絕，競爭勢力可先登用而造成招攬失敗',()=>{let m=model();m=act(m,{type:'Recruit',candidateId:'sample-guide'});m=advancePhase4(m,ENGINEERING.recruitmentDays);expect(m.candidates.find(c=>c.id==='sample-guide')?.status).toBe('refused');m=model(190);m=act(m,{type:'Recruit',candidateId:'sample-scribe'});expect(m.candidates.find(c=>c.id==='sample-scribe')?.status).toBe('refused');expect(m.externalUpdates.length).toBeGreaterThan(0);});

 it('空缺在外部日常運作中由既有署理人才繼任，到任前職位仍空缺',()=>{let m=advancePhase4(model(),30);expect(m.offices.some(o=>o.appointment?.personId==='sample-deputy')).toBe(true);expect(m.offices.every(o=>!o.holderId)).toBe(true);m=advancePhase4(m,ENGINEERING.appointmentTravelDays);expect(m.offices.some(o=>o.holderId==='sample-deputy')).toBe(true);});
 it('A25 政策按月改變糧、人口、支持與利益反應',()=>{let m=model();const before=m.territories[0];m=act(m,{type:'SetPolicy',territoryId:before.id,policy:'屯田與水利'});m=advancePhase4(m,30);expect(m.territories[0].grain).toBe(before.grain+ENGINEERING.policyYieldPerMonth);expect(m.territories[0].population).toBeGreaterThan(before.population);expect(m.territories[0].support).toBeGreaterThan(before.support);expect(m.territories[0].interests.farmers).toBeGreaterThan(before.interests.farmers);});
 it('A25 五層土地控制必須逐級推進，不可把軍事進入當完全實控',()=>{let m=model();m=act(m,{type:'SetControl',territoryId:'sample-county',control:'軍事進入'});expect(m.territories[0].control).toBe('軍事進入');expect(()=>act(m,{type:'SetControl',territoryId:'sample-county',control:'完全實控'})).toThrow('逐級');for(const level of ['初步接收','穩定治理','完全實控'] as const)m=act(m,{type:'SetControl',territoryId:'sample-county',control:level});expect(m.territories[0].control).toBe('完全實控');});
 it('普通運輸按既有路線扣發地糧，抵達後數量守恆且所有權不變',()=>{let m=model();const from=m.territories[0],to=m.territories[1],initial=from.grain+to.grain;m=act(m,{type:'SendConvoy',routeId:'route-county-market',owner:'家族帳',item:'糧',quantity:40,from:from.name,to:to.name});expect(m.territories[0].grain).toBe(from.grain-40);expect(m.convoys[0].status).toBe('traveling');m=advancePhase4(m,ENGINEERING.travelDaysPerRoute);expect(m.convoys[0]).toMatchObject({status:'arrived',owner:'家族帳',quantity:40});expect(m.territories[0].grain+m.territories[1].grain).toBe(initial);});
 it('A30 戰役部隊與指揮官不得重複；預備隊獨立，投入後只轉現役一次',()=>{let m=model();expect(()=>act(m,{type:'StartBattle',id:'bad',location:'渡口',units:[unit('u1','same','甲'),unit('u2','same','甲')],protagonistPresent:false})).toThrow('重複');m=act(m,{type:'StartBattle',id:'battle',location:'汝南渡口（示例）',units:[unit('u1','a','甲'),unit('u2','b','乙')],protagonistPresent:false});expect(m.battle!.units[0]).toMatchObject({strength:100,reserve:50});m=act(m,{type:'BattleRound',orders:{u1:'進攻',u2:'防守'}});expect(m.battle!.units[0].reserve).toBe(0);expect(m.battle!.units[0].strength).toBeLessThan(150);expect(m.battle!.units[0].killed+m.battle!.units[0].wounded).toBeGreaterThan(0);});
 it('A30 雙線編制分開戰區總指揮與帶兵主將；部隊僅有一個位置、跨線調動守恆',()=>{let m=act(model(),{type:'StartMultiFrontExample'}),campaign=m.campaign!;const force=(c:typeof campaign)=>c.units.reduce((sum,u)=>sum+u.strength+u.reserve+u.wounded+u.killed+u.routed,0);const total=force(campaign);expect(campaign.fronts).toHaveLength(2);expect(new Set(campaign.units.map(u=>u.commanderId)).size).toBe(campaign.units.length);for(const front of campaign.fronts){expect(front.overallCommanderId).not.toBe(campaign.units.find(u=>front.unitIds.includes(u.id))?.commanderId);expect(front.unitIds).toHaveLength(1);}expect(()=>act(m,{type:'StartBattle',id:'duplicate-front-battle',location:'汝南渡口（示例）',units:[unit('unit-river','captain-river','重複部隊')],protagonistPresent:false})).toThrow('重複');m=act(m,{type:'TransferBetweenFronts',unitId:'unit-river',toFrontId:'front-road'});expect(m.campaign!.fronts.find(f=>f.id==='front-river')?.unitIds).toEqual([]);expect(m.campaign!.transfers).toHaveLength(1);expect(m.campaign!.units.find(u=>u.id==='unit-river')?.location).toContain('行軍中');expect(force(m.campaign!)).toBe(total);expect(m.campaign!.fronts.flatMap(f=>f.unitIds)).not.toContain('unit-river');m=advancePhase4(m,ENGINEERING.travelDaysPerRoute);expect(m.campaign!.fronts.find(f=>f.id==='front-road')?.unitIds).toContain('unit-river');expect(m.campaign!.units.find(u=>u.id==='unit-river')?.location).toBe('潁川驛路（示例）');expect(force(m.campaign!)).toBe(total);expect(m.campaign!.fronts.flatMap(f=>f.unitIds).filter(id=>id==='unit-river')).toHaveLength(1);});
 it('A31 主角親臨戰場留下局部目擊，戰鬥逐輪記錄後果而非摘要勝負',()=>{let m=act(model(),{type:'StartBattle',id:'battle-scene',location:'渡口前線（示例）',units:[unit('u1','a','甲'),unit('u2','b','乙')],protagonistPresent:true});expect(m.battle!.witnesses).toEqual(['主角近旁目擊者（局部）']);m=act(m,{type:'BattleRound',orders:{u1:'進攻',u2:'防守'}});expect(m.battle!.logs.at(-1)).toMatch(/主角親臨/);expect(m.battle!.units.some(u=>u.killed>0||u.wounded>0)).toBe(true);});
 it('A29 永久主權條款須列出領地與承接者；草案不改主權，明確批准才變更',()=>{let m=model();const oldOwner=m.territories[0].owner;expect(()=>act(m,{type:'DraftTreaty',id:'incomplete',proposer:'鄰近勢力',clauses:[{id:'land',text:'永久割讓',sovereign:true}]})).toThrow('受影響領地');m=act(m,{type:'DraftTreaty',id:'cession',proposer:'鄰近勢力',clauses:[{id:'cession-clause',text:'永久割讓潁川東部示例縣予鄰近勢力',sovereign:true,territoryId:'sample-county',successorOwner:'鄰近勢力（示例）'}]});expect(m.treaties[0].status).toBe('pending-player');expect(m.territories[0].owner).toBe(oldOwner);m=act(m,{type:'DecideTreaty',treatyId:'cession',decision:'approve'});expect(m.treaties[0].status).toBe('approved');expect(m.territories[0].owner).toBe('鄰近勢力（示例）');expect(m.eventLedger.at(-1)?.detail).toMatch(/玩家明確批准主權條款/);});
